(xii)
the preparation of the plans and the estimates of works proposed to be constructed partly or wholly at the expense of
the Market Committee and the grant of sanction to such plans and estimates;
(xiii)
the registers and books to be maintained by a Market Committee;
(xiv)
the form in which the accounts of a Market Committee shall be kept, the manner in which they shall be audited and the
